ong class='sig'>+0.35\u00b0F per decade</strong> (95% range +0.27 to +0.43), about +4.5\u00b0F since 1895.","t_mon":"Lows rose in all 12 months. Highs rose in 10 of 12 months.","t_rain":"Rain and snow: no clear long-term change","p_rain":"Roswell's yearly precipitation shows no clear long-term change (\u22120.21 inches per decade, a range that includes zero). The 1991\u20132020 normal is 11.6 inches a year. The wettest year was 1941 (32.90 in); the driest, 2003 (2.90 in).","show_snow":true,"sig_bars":{"lo":true,"hi":true},"t_year":"2026 so far: 17 daily record highs, 3 daily record lows"}}